markedup_text = "Lure the snake away with a hot stone."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_k52r6")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_5rtn8")
markedup_result_text = "The merchant picks up a large, hot stone from the ground and sets it in front of the snake.

It only takes a few minutes before the snake gives up the melons, sensing the greater warmth, and lazily transfers itself to the rock."

